@startuml
!include course-style.puml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Console application\nApp / CommandDispatcher" as Console SHELL
component "Tasks\nTaskService / RecurringTaskService" as Tasks DOMAIN
component "Commitments\nCommitmentService" as Commitments DOMAIN
component "Planning\nPlanner / ScheduleService" as Planning DOMAIN
component "Persistence\nStorage / FileStorage / codecs" as Persistence PERSISTENCE
component "Source model\nSnapshot / Task / Commitment" as Model VALUES

Console ..> Tasks : validates / materializes
Console ..> Commitments : validates
Console ..> Planning : generates / projects
Console ..> Persistence : loads / saves
Tasks ..> Model
Commitments ..> Model
Planning ..> Model
Persistence ..> Model
Persistence ..> Planning : encodes frozen results

note as ConsoleNote
  Main wires the application.
  Selected module dependencies are shown;
  common validation and Java APIs are omitted.
end note
ConsoleNote -[dotted]-> Console
@enduml
